From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:49:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2757/3799] soh: rename func_80030488 ->
 Actor_RemoveFaroresWindLight

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: removes that light from the light context
Defined in soh/src/code/z_actor.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/code/z_actor.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/code/z_actor.c b/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
index 0996e9f40..369c89a68 100644
--- a/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
+++ b/soh/src/code/z_actor.c
@@ -2544,7 +2544,8 @@ void Actor_DrawFaroresWindPointer(PlayState* play) {
     CLOSE_DISPS(play->state.gfxCtx);
 }
 
-void func_80030488(PlayState* play) {
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80030488: removes that light from the light context
+void Actor_RemoveFaroresWindLight(PlayState* play) {
     LightContext_RemoveLight(play, &play->lightCtx, D_8015BC10);
 }
 
@@ -3262,7 +3263,7 @@ void func_80031C3C(ActorContext* actorCtx, PlayState* play) {
     }
 
     Play_SaveSceneFlags(play);
-    func_80030488(play);
+    Actor_RemoveFaroresWindLight(play);  // was func_80030488 [LLM:HIGH]
 }
 
 /**
